``` ===== 9. An ARTEX console inside your network: update check and repository pulls through the proxy ===== ```
index=proxy (http_user_agent="artex-selfupdate" OR url="*api.github.com/repos/Hinln/ARTEX*" OR url="*github.com/Hinln/ARTEX*" OR url="*github.com/Autumn-27/ARTEX*" OR url="*github.com/Autumn-27/norma*")
| stats count min(_time) as first max(_time) as last values(url) as urls by src user
| convert ctime(first) ctime(last)
